window.products.push({"id":138067,"name":"R.W.FLAME Ice Makers Countertop，Ice Maker 6 Minutes 9 Ice Cubes 24 Hours 26 lbs Self-Cleaning Portable Ice Maker with Handle and Ice Scoop, Ice Maker ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DpuCtQyfL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Makes 2 Sizes Of Ice Cubes】RW ice makers countertop can provide you with high quality ice cubes, you can make S/L size ice cubes according to your needs, S size is more suitable for freezing seafood or beer, L ice cubes can be directly applied to drinks, it is the perfect companion that you can't live without to enjoy your life. 【Quick And Quiet Ice Making】This countertop ice maker takes only 6 minutes to get 9 pieces of bullet ice and can produce 26lb per day. This Ice Makers Countertop allows you to get pure ice quickly, it will cool your drinks quickly and make your own ice so you never have to buy ice again! 【Self-Cleaning & Portable】Our ice maker machine comes with a self-cleaning feature and a double handle design, the handle of the ice basket is removable for easy cleaning and removal from the ice maker. 5S is all it takes to activate the self-cleaning feature and it will ensure that every piece of ice you use is healthy and pure. 【Easy To Use】The top of the countertop ice machine is transparent, so you can clearly watch the ice making process, and the convenient carrying handle design will make it easier for you to use. The small ice maker with handle is more suitable for you to use for multiple occasions, such as party/travel/camping, etc. 【Unique And Modern Design】This ice machine has a unique and stylish appearance, product dimensions 8.74 inches deep x 11.42 inches wide x 11.57 inches high weight, water tank capacity of 1.3 liters, ice storage capacity of 1.3 pounds, ice basket volume kg 0.6, easy for you to better store ice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DpuCtQyfL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"R.W.FLAME","source_asin":"B0CB6JRLN8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CB6JRLN8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0CB6JRLN8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":138068,"name":"PETSITE Countertop Dishwasher, Portable Dishwasher w/ 5 Washing Programs, 6 Place Settings, 360° Dual Spray, High-Temperature Drying, Compact Kitchen ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gPFH5Z73L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: Still bothered by washing dishes? Our countertop dishwasher can free your hands and save you time. The portable dishwasher can wash 6 place settings (72 pieces of tableware) at the same time. According to the kind of tableware and the amount of greasy dirt, you can select 5 different washing programs on the easy-to-operate LED touch panel. Then, the dual spray arms will rotate 360° and deliver powerful water sprays to rinse off stains and oil deeply. After washing, the high temperature inside can dry dishes quickly. If the dishwasher is short of rinse aid or water, the indicators on the screen will light up. Moreover, the child lock makes the dishwasher safer to use in families with children. 24H delay function also brings you much convenience. As for installation, it's quite simple. The dishwasher fits on the countertop and also fits into the cabinet.   Features: Hold up to 6 place settings at one time, fit up to 10\" plate  The bowl basket, cutlery basket, cup shelf for reasonable organization 5 washing programs for different tableware and amount of greasy dirt Dual 360° swivel spray arms with 23 water ports for deep cleaning Dry dishes quickly with high temperature Detachable filter for convenient daily cleaning  Customize start washing time with 24H delay function  LED touch screen offers easy operation and shows remaining cycle time  Indicators remind you of adding rinse aid or opening your faucet Child lock ensures high level of security  Countertop or embedded dishwasher for you to choose from ETL and DOE certification   Specifications: Color:White  Material:ABS, Stainless Steel  Product Dimensions:21.7 x 19.7 x 17.7 inch (L x W x H) Net Weight:42 lbs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gPFH5Z73L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PETSITE","source_asin":"B0BFX8VLM9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFX8VLM9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFX8VLM9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
