window.products.push({"id":138262,"name":"Beaquicy WB30T10074 Stove Burner Replacement 8 inch for ge Electric Kenmore Hotpoint Stove/Oven - Surface Element Coil Suitable for jbs07c2ww, 911.927","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dfBBLuVrL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝗪𝗕𝟯𝟬𝗧𝟭𝟬𝟬𝟳𝟰 𝗦𝗨𝗥𝗙𝗔𝗖𝗘 𝗕𝗨𝗥𝗡𝗘𝗥 𝗘𝗟𝗘𝗠𝗘𝗡𝗧】:The WB30T10074 Surface Burner Element is for stoves.The WB30T10074 burner element has 5 turns of coil, 1 \"Y\" bracket and is RATED at 2600 watts, 240 volts.The surface element delivers heat to the cooking zone at the top of the range for a quick and even heating area. Product includes 1 x 8-inch plug-in burner. 【𝗛𝗜𝗚𝗛 𝗧𝗘𝗠𝗣𝗘𝗥𝗔𝗧𝗨𝗥𝗘 𝗥𝗘𝗦𝗜𝗦𝗧𝗔𝗡𝗧 𝗠𝗔𝗧𝗘𝗥𝗜𝗔𝗟】:WB30T10074 Electric Stove Range Surface Burner is made of made of HIGH TEMPERATURE RESISTANT stainless steel alloy material for excellent durability and firmness.▶PAY ATTENTION---If the stove is not flat on the stovetop, make sure that the connecting bolts are parallel and push down a little bit. If there is a little smoke when WB30T10074 Electric Range Burner Surface Element is used for the first time, please don't panic. This is normal. This is a green coating applied by the factory to prevent scratches during transportation. 【𝗦𝗨𝗜𝗧𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘 𝗙𝗢𝗥 𝗠𝗢𝗥𝗘 𝗕𝗥𝗔𝗡𝗗𝗦 𝗢𝗙 𝗕𝗨𝗥𝗡𝗘𝗥】: WB30T10074 Surface Element can replacement for GE, Hotpoint burners.▶WB30T10074 8 Inch Surface Element Replaces Numbers: JBP24WH2WW, JBP24BH2WH, JBS23BC1CT, JBS23BC1WH, JBS23BC2AD, JBS23BC2WH, JBS03BC1AD, JBS03BC1CT, JBS03BC2WH, JBS03BH2CT, JBS03C1AD, JBS03C1CT, JBS03C2WH, JBP21WH1WW, JBP26AB4AA, JBP26BB2AD, JBP26CH1CC, RB536WH2WW, RB536BK2BB, RB536BC2AD, RB536BC1CT, RB530WC1WW, RB757BH2WH, RB757BC3CT, RB757BC2CT, RB757BC2WH, RB536BC1WH, RB753BB1, RB757BH3WH, RB757BH5CT, RB757WB1, etc. 【𝟯𝟲𝟱 𝗗𝗔𝗬𝗦 𝗪𝗔𝗥𝗥𝗔𝗡𝗧𝗬】:WB30T10074 electric stove burner replacement supports 365 DAYS RETURN and EXCHANGE.Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. If WB30T10074 surface element is broken, the burner will have the following conditions, and the burner surface element need to be replaced in time: ①The old one is damaged ②Uneven heating ③Can't place balance. 【𝗦𝗜𝗠𝗣𝗟𝗘 𝗜𝗡𝗦𝗧𝗔𝗟𝗟𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡】:The WB30T10074 surface burner elements, those metal components that get red-hot and generate heat, are the most important parts of any range. WB30T10074 Surface element kit easy to install.Before replacement, disconnect the power supply and wear working gloves to ensure the safety of your hands.When the elements fail to heat properly, it's time to replace them.Please check the dimensions as shown on the photos to ensure they fit your stove before puechasing. If the range burner does not sit flat on your stove, make sure the connection bolts are parallel and pushed a bit down.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dfBBLuVrL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0854HSRQZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138262","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0854HSRQZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0854HSRQZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
