window.products.push({"id":138337,"name":"10 Turkey Shrink Bags 18\" X 28\" (10) Made in The USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F7E99TikL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"These TOP Quality Turkey Shrink Bags allow you to keep poultry refrigerated before freezing. Give your fresh Turkey a professional look. Your 16 to 26 pound bird will fit nicely. - Made in The USA. Freezer Safe. ****Please NOTE the bags are lightly coated with starch to prevent sticking*** HOW TO USE THE SHRINK BAGS? Two good options are: OPTION A we will pierce a small pin hole in the bag and OPTION B we will use a small hose or solid straw (Not included) to let the air escape. let's start with OPTION A \"The pin hole method\". A.1 In a large pot, bring water to +/- 180 degrees Fahrenheit. A.2 After dressing your Turkey, make sure you drain it as well as possible. A.3 Place bird, head first into the bag. A.4 Push the air out. We do this by giving the bird a \"hug.\" A.5 Twist the open end shut (make a pigtail) and secure with a zip tie. A.6 In the section of the Turkey between the top of breast, pierce a small hole. Doing this will ensure that air can escape. A.7 Then, dip the bag into the heated water (+/- 180 F) for 2 to 3 seconds. Dip again if needed. (Don't dip too long water will enter the bag through the small pin hole) A.8 Then dry of with a towel and if desired place a product label over the small pin hole. THE END Next is OPTION B, no piercing here! B.1 In a large pot, bring water to +/- 180 degrees F. B.2 After dressing your Turkey, make sure you drain it as well as possible. B.3 Place bird, head first into the bag. B.4 Push the air out. We do this by giving the bird a \"hug.\" B.5 Place a small hose of solid straw B.6 Twist the open end shut (make a pigtail) with the small hose or straw sticking out and secure with a zip tie. B.7 Dip the bird into the heated water (180 F) for 2 to 3 seconds. Dip again if needed. B.8 Remove the hose or straw and re-tighten the zip tie. B.9 Then dry of with a towel and if desired place your product label.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F7E99TikL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Michigan Quality Products LLC","source_asin":"B07XF1VT86","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XF1VT86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XF1VT86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":138338,"name":"METRONIC Impulse Sealer 16 inch, Manual Heat Sealer Machine for Plastic Bags, Shrink Wrap Bag Sealers Heavy Duty Sealing Machine With Repair Kit (Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61umAmHeOCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tabletop Impulse Heat Sealer --- Important Notice: The light only turns on and the sealer is activated when the handle is pressed down! The Metronic tabletop impulse sealer, quickly seals different types of plastic packaging. Safe and Easy to Use --- Metronic impulse sealers are safe and easy to use. The heating element in the impulse sealer is not constantly heated. The light will turn on when the sealer is activated, and will turn off once sealing is completed. No Warmup Time Needed --- No warmup or cooldown time needed, safe and simple to use. Impulse sealers are very convenient and safe because they can be immediately used, and the chance of being burned is minimal. Adjustable Timer Setting - Adjustable heat settings for the different materials. For most applications, using the impulse heat sealer at heat setting of 3 is sufficient. Quality Guarantee --- At Jiaro International, we are deeply committed to provid a superior shopping experience to our customers.If you have any questions, you can contact us at any time and Metronic will solve it for you in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61umAmHeOCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"METRONIC","source_asin":"B0B7NYX3G3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7NYX3G3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7NYX3G3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":138339,"name":"2 Pack French Door Refrigerator Spring For Kenmore Elite 795.71053.010","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FYOZF5-BL._AC_SL1306_.jpg","description":"Customized For Kenmore Elite. Compatible Models:795.71053.010 Package includes:2 x French door refrigerator spring INSTALLATION: The spring has two vertical ends to it, one is a 90 degree angle and the other is a bit crooked before it goes up a 90 degrees. The straight 90 degree angle side should face the bottom. To install it, you need to put the top crooked side in first, pull the flap as much as you can toward the refrigerator and then install the bottom side. The spring should keep the flap flush to the door.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FYOZF5-BL._AC_SL1306_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dinghosen","source_asin":"B07DLQHH14","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DLQHH14","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DLQHH14","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":138340,"name":"Overbest XWF Replacement for GE® XWF Refrigerator Water Filter, 3 Pack (Not XWFE)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i6yWnmgiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Please note the filter is replacement for XWF (No chip included), not GE XWFE (with chip). [Overview] We started Overbest to disrupt the traditional water filtration industry with easy-to-use and affordable replacement water filters. As a young startup, we use the latest filtration technologies to provide efficient clean water solutions for you in your home. The Overbest replacement refrigerator filter for GE XWF is NSF 42 and NSF 372 certified and uses only premium materials that have passed rigorous in-house lab testing to provide you with higher quality drinking water. [High-efficiency filtration] The Overbest replacement refrigerator filter for GE XWF by Overbest is NSF 42 certified to reduce chlorine by up to 97% while improving the taste of water. This is how we ensure safe and delicious water for you and your family. [Superior materials] The Overbest replacement refrigerator filter for GE XWF is also NSF 372 certified to ensure lead-free materials. It is also BPA-free and adopts coconut shell carbon block to ensure healthy filtered water. Our filters are precisely designed to fit your refrigerator- no annoying leaks or installation issues. [Economic solution] The Overbest replacement refrigerator filter for GE XWF needs to be replaced after 6 months (equivalent to 200 gallons) of use. That means fresh, clean drinking water costs an average of 8 cents a day. Overbest believes that everyone deserves a healthy life. [Month install stickers] Simply attach the correct month sticker on your replacement water filter to remind you when it needs to be replaced. [Fresh-tasting water] The natural coconut shell carbon block adopted by our water filter provides a better water taste by absorbing more impurities than cheaper mixed carbon block filters. We carefully supervise the entire production process in the factory. Each Overbest product has undergone multiple lab tests before shipping out to provide you the superior quality water filter in the industry. [Replacement for refrigerator filter models] This Overbest refrigerator filter is a replacement for GE XWF, Waterdrop XWF, GE WR17X30702, Maxblue MB-XWF, AQUACREST AQF-XWF, FilterLogic FL-RF48, Waterspecialist WS648A, Crystala CF9, Glacier Fresh GF-XWF, Pureza PF9. [Compatible with refrigerator models] This Overbest replacement filter is compatible with GBE21, GDE21, GDE25, GFE24, GFE26, GNE21, GNE25, GNE27, GWE19, GYE18, QNE27, GSE25, GSS23, GSS25, GZS22, PSE25, CZS22, GNE27JSMSS, GNE27JMMES, GNE27ESMSS, GNE27JGMBB, GNE27JGMWW, GSE23, GSE23G, GSE26, CFE26, XFE26, CWE19 GE is a registered trademark of General Electric Company. GE is used for reference purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i6yWnmgiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Overbest","source_asin":"B08FTD4ZL2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FTD4ZL2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FTD4ZL2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
