window.products.push({"id":138359,"name":"SINDA Handcrafted Custom Copper Range Hood with Commercial Grade Hood SUS304 Vent with Liner and Fan Motor, Baffle Filter, 42\"W x 30\"H, Wall Mount, An","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4027.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614hqr1DWiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Size Guide】: 42\"W x 21\"D x 30\"H wall mount, Antique Copper-Light Hammered. For better performance, wall mount range hoods should be the same width as or 3\"- 6\" wider than your cooktop. The height range between your cooktop and the copper hood should be 30\" to 36\" (33\" is recommended). We can make any hood size you need, please contact our custom service via Amazon.com for a quote. 【Ventilation】: Comes with build-in/insert range hood with 4 speed fan, adjustable LED lights, baffle filter(reusable, dish-washer safe). 30\"/36\"W - max airflow(noise level):610 CFM(6.5Sone), 6\" round duct; 42\"/48\"W -max airflow(noise level): 1150 CFM(7.5Sone), 8\" round duct. ** Ductless conversion (recirculating) and remote blowers (motor in attic) ventilation options available upon request by email. 【Unique Features】: SINDA Custom Range Hood is handcrafted from 16 Gauge solid copper (99.9% pure virgin copper) by skilled craftsmen. Our H3LBST model is a traditional copper stove hood featuring a five-sided design and I'll recommend it for its antique copper color, two classic vertical brass straps with exquisite rivets in the front, one strap in the apron and all free choices of designs according to your preference. 【Care & Maintenance】: SINDA copper hood come with a protective coating to preserve the finish you select. For daily maintenance, simply clean your copper hood with mild soap and warm water. Do not use copper polish, abrasive materials or harsh cleaners. 【Service & Warranty】: SINDA will provide CAD drawings for your approval upon receipt of your order. The hood pics will also be sent to you for approval before shipment. Want to get samples to touch the color and texture for yourself? Just feel free to contact us. ***SINDA offers a lifetime warranty on copper hood covers& a two-year parts limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614hqr1DWiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SINDA","source_asin":"B082DBBB38","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082DBBB38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B082DBBB38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
