window.products.push({"id":138514,"name":"CAFEC 100-Pack Cone-shaped V60 02 Style Universal 1 to 4 Cup Disposable Pour-Over Drip Coffee Paper Filter made of Eco-Friendly Refined Virgin Pulp fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+BRmCnAGL._SL1207_.jpg","description":"Specialty Coffee Paper Filters for Specialty Coffee! This is not just paper, it is specialty paper filters for a cup of specialty coffee: Filter paper made of REFINED PULP (White version): The more commonly seen brewer filters are refined to remove the brown color. It keeps the original flavor of the coffee grounds and makes a very robust pourover drip coffee. NO USED PULP, DYES OR CHEMICALS ARE EVER USED IN THESE PAPER FILTERS. Completely biodegradable. FSC Certified: The FSC certificate shows that the banana-tree fiber to make the paper is only sourced from well-managed, eco-friendly forests. 100% sustainable: No wood is used in the paper making process: ABACA: Manilla Hemp, is extracted from the leaf-stems of a certain species of banana tree, leaving the wood and tree completely intact. Paper making process: Dewatering: Dewater pulp and make a paper sheet. Drying: Dry the paper sheet by heating. Rolling: Roll the paper sheet under finely tuned and adjusted rolling pressure. No bleach, glues, chemicals or unnatural elements are added to the pulp. This is simply a 100% clean, eco-friendly, forest-sustainable paper filter. Period. You will not be disappointed by the strength and suppleness of these highly crafted filters. They will certainly stand out above the rest and make you the perfect cup of joe in the morning - every single time! If you love coffee and if making coffee is a labor of love, these filters - will enhance the quality of your morning coffee making routine! They are elegant, supple and strong. They make the cleanest, consistent coffee. They are made of superior eco-friendly certified materials. Clean-up is a cinch... When done, simply discard filter with used grounds inside.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+BRmCnAGL._SL1207_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAFEC","source_asin":"B076MCYZ9R","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076MCYZ9R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B076MCYZ9R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
