window.products.push({"id":138566,"name":"Reusable Nespresso Capsules - Pack of 3 - Stainless Steel Refillable Pods Compatible with Nespresso Machines Premium Espresso Tamper and 150 Foil Lids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814Dx+idD4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM REUSABLE ESPRESSO CAPSULES: The NEW ABG Stainless steel refillable capsule Design has been tirelessly tested and improved to give you the best aromatic experience from home-made espresso. Simply scoop 5- 6 grams of your favorite fine ground espresso and tamp down with our spoon and included tamper. Place on foil lid and your are ready for an amazing brew. These new refillable pods for Original Nespresso machines lets you create the finest espresso with rich crema to start your day FOOD GRADE STAINLESS STEEL! BPA-FREE AND 100% NON-TOXIC: For the best coffees there's nothing better than these high quality made 304 food grade stainless steel reusable capsules for Nespresso machines. Created to offer you a safe and easy way to brew your own espresso coffee, without worrying about poor quality and weak taste. Because they are stainless steel and reusable they produce less waste and are an eco-friendly better choice for the environment compared to single use pods EASY-TO-CLEAN, ECO-FRIENDLY AND EASY TO USE: The only stainless steel refillable capsules that save you from nasty cleaning sessions. Worry less about clogging, intense scrubbing and intensive cleaning. These refillable pods of Nespresso machines let you rinse it with a spray head in as fast as 20 seconds with the help of our brush, leave it to dry and use it for another round of great-tasting coffee PRECISELY COMPATIBLE: Reusable Pods Compatible with Most Nespresso Original Line such as Inissia C40 and D40, F111 Lattissima One, Lattissima Pro F456, Lattissima Touch, CitiZ & Milk C122, CitiZ C112, CitiZ D112, Expert C80, Creatista Plus, Expert & Milk C85, Pixie C60, Pixie C60P, Pixie Clips and M-SCISHARE EXTENDED LIFETIME & 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - We stand by our customers making them our top priority. Made from durable food grade BPA-free stainless steel that allows for extended lifetime of pods. Reusable Nespresso capsules created to give you the best cups of coffee and unparalleled enjoyment. Backed with highly-responsive customer support team, a one-year warranty and a money-back guarantee, you're up for the best deal you could ever get","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814Dx+idD4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alchemy Bar Goods","source_asin":"B07PYZS5PK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PYZS5PK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PYZS5PK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
