window.products.push({"id":138705,"name":"Kleenwater Water Filter 2-Set Compatible with Selecto Scientific MF 620 C System with O-Rings","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m2UOJifrL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This high quality after market cartridge 2-set is a compatible replacement which can be used with Selecto Scientific MF 620 C System. Typically this filter set is used as pre-filtration for fountain beverage machines and other commercial food service industry applications providing clear and great tasting water free from chlorine and chemicals. The carbon block cartridge will remove chlorine for 40,000 gallons through the process of adsorption. The KWS4520CB also provides 5 micron sediment filtration furnishing crystal clear water. To provide perspective to the 5 micron sediment entrapment rating it is important to note the naked human eye can see down to 20 micron and a human hair is 100 microns in diameter. This sophisticated filtration will provide very high quality - great tasting water and will protect your beverage equipment from the potential adverse effects of unfiltered water. The reasonable cost makes this a very high quality - low cost alternative. Please note that replacement o rings are also included with this kit. Approximate cartridge dimension 4.5\"(W) x 20(L) with the double o ring upper connection configuration. This cartridge weighs approximately 5 1/2 lbs  The KWBGS4520-5M sediment filter is approximately 4.5\" (L) x 20\" (W). This water filter cartridge is equipped with the Selecto Scientific top double o ring connection configuration and is compatible with model # 101-300. The 5 micron filtration will protect the (1) 101-298 alternative cartridge from pre-mature fouling from excessive sediment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m2UOJifrL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KleenWater","source_asin":"B01GEEY1KK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GEEY1KK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GEEY1KK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":138706,"name":"Whirlpool WP6-3033630 OEM Dryer Idler Pulley Arm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yHUYE9GHL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"The Dryer Idler Pulley Arm attaches to the idler pulley wheel, and the idler pulley wheel helps the drive belt rotate the dryer drum. You need to replace this part mainly if the bearing is damaged. To access this part, you'll need to remove your dryer door and the front panel of your dryer. This high-quality, durable replacement part is easy to install with basic hand tools, such as a multi-screwdriver. It only requires some disassembly of the dryer and novice repair experience. Before installing this part, unplug the appliance or shut off the house circuit breaker to ensure safety. Recommended Items: Drive Belt (item 661570V). The drive belt is a long, slender belt that wraps around the dryer drum, a tension pulley, and then around the drive motor pulley. The belt is likely broken if the drum will not turn when the dryer is turned on. Consider replacing the idler pulley while the dryer is disassembled (item W10116792).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yHUYE9GHL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whirlpool","source_asin":"B077BPJH3H","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077BPJH3H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B077BPJH3H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":138707,"name":"KitchenAid KEBS279BSS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w6VL3iE6L._AC_SL1290_.jpg","description":"This 27-inch double wall oven features our innovative Even-Heat True Convection System and Even-Heat Preheat in both ovens. This combination helps remove cold spots to help ensure you get the results you crave without the need for baking stones or rotating pans. A glass-touch oven display has intuitive left-to-right programming that makes it easy to program both ovens. Even-Heat True Convection Oven (both ovens) Provides consistent heating and even cooking on all racks with a unique bow-tie shaped design and convection fan that helps ensure the most even baking. Even-Heat Preheat (both ovens) Helps remove cold spots to help ensure even baking because the entire oven, including the walls and racks, are heated to the correct temperature. EasyConvect Conversion System (both ovens) Takes guesswork out of convection cooking by ensuring you can get exceptional results when experimenting with new or familiar recipes. Additional Features Temperature Probe (both ovens) Allows accurate measurement of internal temperature of meats, poultry, and casseroles without having to open the oven door. Glass-Touch Display with Control Lock Function Features a responsive, easy-to-use interface that is also easy to clean. SatinGlide Roll-Out Extension Rack (both ovens) Allows easy loading and features an easy-grip handle, giving you the confidence when cooking with large or heavy dishes. FIT System Installation Includes flexible design elements that allow you to customize your wall oven installation to the height of your existing cabinet. 4000W, 8-Pass Broil Element (both ovens) Combines the high power and even coverage needed to more closely approximate outdoor grilling. 4.3 Cu. Ft. Capacity (both ovens) The spacious capacity simultaneously accommodates multiple dishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w6VL3iE6L._AC_SL1290_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B0097IZ010","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0097IZ010","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0097IZ010","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
