window.products.push({"id":138756,"name":"6931EL3003C High Limit Thermostat Dryer 6931EL3004B LG Assembly AGM30045804 6323EL2001B 6931EL3003F Part DLE2516W DLE3777W DLE5955W DLE5977W DLEX7177W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M0XfBCGMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Dryer High Limit Thermostat 6931el3003c - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP4457603, 1268365, 6931EL3003G, PS3530484. Thermostat 6931el3003c is compatible with LG and Kenmore appliances. It is designed to monitor the temperature inside the dryer drum and shut off the heating element if the temperature gets too high. Lg 6931el3003c is a safety feature that helps prevent fires and damage to the dryer. Thermostat fits hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Lg 6931el3003c Dryer Thermostat will help if your appliance produces no heat or not enough heat. It is important to ensure that the power to the dryer is turned off before attempting to replace the 6931el3003c Lg Thermostat. Wear work gloves to protect your hands during the repair. 💡 The 6931el3004b 6931el3003c Thermostat Assembly is made of durable materials and is built to withstand the extreme temperatures and conditions inside a dryer. When the temperature inside the dryer drum reaches a certain level, the thermostat will trip, cutting off power to the heating element. This prevents the dryer from overheating and potentially causing a fire. Our Thermostat meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 How do you check a high limit thermostat continuity? To check the continuity of a high limit thermostat, you will need a multimeter. Turn off the power supply to the appliance and disconnect the wires from the thermostat. Set the multimeter to the continuity setting and touch the probes to the terminals of the thermostat. If the multimeter shows low resistance, the thermostat is functioning properly; if it shows high resistance, the thermostat is faulty and needs to be replaced. 💡 Can I bypass high limit thermostat? The Lg High Limit Thermostat 6931el3003c is designed to protect the appliance from overheating and potentially causing damage or even a fire. Bypassing the high limit thermostat could potentially cause the appliance to overheat and pose a safety risk. It is important to address the underlying issue causing the high limit thermostat to trip rather than bypassing it. It is recommended to replace the previous part if it's damaged or doesn't work properly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M0XfBCGMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B088TX3ZY6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088TX3ZY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B088TX3ZY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
