window.products.push({"id":138936,"name":"Aneken 120 Can Beverage Refrigerator and Cooler, Beer Fridge Drink Fridge with 2 Layer Glass Door Adjustable Shelves for Soda, Beer, Juice, LED Light ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HJcXCA3gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LARGE CAPACITY】 - Aneken 3.2 Cu.Ft Beverage Refrigerator and Cooler are equipped with a Black Stainless Steel Frame, Adjustable and Stable Shelves make you conveniently store options up to 120 cans of standardized beverage. Compact, Freestanding Setup Requires No Mounting—Just Place, Plug, & Enjoy. 【TEMPERATURE CONTROLS & LED LIGHTS】 - The Adjustable Thermostat has a 7-grade Manual Temperature Control Knob, makes an approximate temperature range of 34℉ - 61℉. Its Memory function automatically restores the preset temperature of the cooler in case it becomes unplugged, or in the event of a power outage. The soft, blue LED interior lighting beautifully showcases your beverages, even at nighttime. 【ECO-POWER ESSECTIVE BEVERAGE COOLER】 - Our 120V 50W Heavy-duty, Vertical Chiller features Energy-efficient advanced technology, and a Whisper-quiet Compressor. The Ultra-cool Compressor works quickly to bring your drinks to the optimal temperature, while Energy-efficient mechanics keep the environment out of It. with our cooler, you won’t just enjoy cold drinks, you’ll have a quiet environment too 【DOUBLE LOW-E GLASS DOOR & PRACTICAL ACCESSORIES】 - A Double-pane Low-E Tempered glass door and air-tight seal ensures maximum insulation. A clear Double-paned glass door makes it easy to see what drinks are being chilled. With 2 Adjustable Feet and 2 pulleys. Easy to move and keep Balance. 3 removable shelves and 5 shelf slots allow you to adjust the height between shelves to accommodate cans and bottles of various sizes and shapes 【HIGH-QUALITY SERVICE】 - Product approved by FCC, 1-year warranty, and 30-day return policy from us. If the product has any problem whatever quality or finding damaged when unboxing. contact us first. This unit measures 31.77\" H x 18.34\" W x 18.7\" D. For best results: keep Beverage Cooler upright for at least 24 hours before first using it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HJcXCA3gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aneken","source_asin":"B092DMWH85","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-138936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092DMWH85","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B092DMWH85","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
